Z||000003||JohnnyK||11-26-2000||03:21 PM||||If I remember correctly, there is a little cylindrical thing to the left of the distributor, with 3 wires coming out of it. One is ground, the other two go to a connector (although I've seen some cars that don't have the connector). It is blue-ish on the ends, although chances are it is very rusty so you can't tell. I'd say it's about 2" long.||||reg||1
